{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Stretch out your hand toward the heavens.</b> Toward that region of the air called heavens, as is explained in the section of Genesis (Genesis 1:7)." "<b>And let there be darkness.</b> And let it remove the natural darkness of night. For the darkness of night is indeed air prepared to receive light, and it is dark only through the absence of light. But this darkness will be air unprepared to receive light due to its great density, and the privation of light will not befall it since it is not disposed toward it — and therefore."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:03.700183251Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}